WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.670
Here's how to move to PadForge from Steam Input,

2
00:00:04.060 --> 00:00:08.210
DS4Windows, reWASD, or SimHub, one game at a time.

3
00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:10.310
You're hearing a generated voice.

4
00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:12.870
First, back up.

5
00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:16.850
On the Profiles page, Export saves the profile you're working on.

6
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:19.730
Coming from Steam Input?

7
00:00:20.380 --> 00:00:22.930
Browse Community Configs imports a Workshop layout.

8
00:00:27.031 --> 00:00:28.961
Give every input one owner.

9
00:00:29.671 --> 00:00:32.101
Stop the old tool for that game, and in Settings,

10
00:00:32.511 --> 00:00:34.801
let HidHide hide the real pad from games.

11
00:00:36.181 --> 00:00:39.231
Then rebuild in layers: the controller type,

12
00:00:39.441 --> 00:00:41.691
then the mappings, then layers and macros.

13
00:00:42.441 --> 00:00:44.671
Test each one in the game before the next.

14
00:00:45.906 --> 00:00:50.896
Keep the old tool and its setup until PadForge does everything the game needs.

15
00:00:53.300 --> 00:00:55.810
Find more guides at padforge.org.
